# Playwright is a webpack EXTERNAL (webpack.config.js), so it is required from
# node_modules at RUNTIME rather than bundled — playwright-core locates browser
# drivers by filesystem path and does not survive bundling. Without these
# un-ignores every packaged build fails `require('playwright')` and visual
# testing is dead on arrival in the VSIX. The browser BINARIES are not shipped
# (hundreds of MB); the user installs them via `npx playwright install chromium`.
!node_modules/playwright/**
!node_modules/playwright-core/**
